     1249                                               , chr(10)
     1250                                               , buf_code-range.first-code
     1251                                               , buf_code-range.last-code
     1252                                             )
     1253           .
     1254           if p-view-mess = true then do:
     1255             message
     1256               v-msg
     1257               view-as alert-box information.
     1258           end.
     1259           else do:
     1260             output stream getmc-stream to "getmc.log" append.
